sequenceDiagram
  participant H as host page
  participant W as Widget
  participant E as ExtensionHost
  participant X as each extension
  H->>W: createEditor({ extensions })
  W->>W: make the hosts (window, commands, editors, preview)
  W->>E: activate(list)
  E->>E: read every contributes
  E->>X: activate(context), in list order
  X->>W: register… (into subscriptions)
  Note over W: editors are made later, per opened file,<br/>with every contribution
  H->>W: dispose()
  W->>X: subscriptions disposed, last first
